    "title": "Another 2 weak tornado touchdowns confirmed in Michigan - NewsBreak",
    "text": "7 hours ago Severe storms overnight and early Wednesday caused at least two weak tornadoes to touch down in Mid-Michigan, leaving damage behind. National Weather Service survey crews spread out across the southern Lower Peninsula today to check areas where damage clusters were reported. At least three tornado touchdown areas were found in West Michigan. Read full article\nRead in NewsBreak 1",
